Syrin is a [[Phenomena/Locality|locality]] near the core of the [[Geography/index|Astra]]. The whole of the planet is held in what its people call the Rhett, a dream laid over the world, and the life of Syrin runs through it as a single weave.

Its people are far ahead of [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]]: they have had trains and firearms for a long time, and most carry machinery worked into the body, which they call chrome, some of it set in the womb. They keep no coin and no guard. A stranger with gold in hand has nothing to trade, because credit is held and spent there by some means an outsider cannot work.

The great city of [[Geography/Syrin (Locality)/Terminus|Terminus]] stands on Syrin.
